From: Open-Ocarina contributors
Subject: [PATCH] Isolate private HS compiler policies in every ANV cache identity
License: MIT (see LICENSE.MIT)

Applies to the hash-pinned private Mesa 26.2.4 source described by the checker.
This changes cache identity only; it does not authorize compiler overrides or
change the driver's existing dispatch-width selection behavior.

